OL,3,ASally Rooney books withdrawn in UK over
OL,4,APalestine Action support
OL,5,
OL,6,FNormal People author Sally Rooney has
OL,7,Fsaid her novels will no longer be
OL,8,Fsupplied to booksellers in the UK as a
OL,9,Fresult of her support for Palestine
OL,10,FAction.
OL,12,FThe Irish novelist said last year she
OL,13,Fintended to carry on using her
OL,14,Froyalties to support the group, which
OL,15,Fis a proscribed terrorist organisation
OL,16,Fin the UK.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
