OL,3,AReform faces criticism after
OL,4,Acouncillors filmed making racist
OL,5,Acomments
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: This report contains racist
OL,8,Fand offensive language.
OL,10,FReform UK has said "there is no room
OL,11,Ffor racism" in its party after ITV News
OL,12,Fbroadcast undercover filming, gathered
OL,13,Fover a year, of some of its councillors
OL,14,Fand candidates using racist, violent
OL,15,Fand sexist language.
OL,17,FIn the film, Undercover: A Year in
OL,18,FReform, a Reform councillor and deputy
OL,19,Fmayor of Solihull is recorded calling
OL,20,FAsian homeowners "parasites".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
