OL,3,ARussell Brand was a 'sexual predator',
OL,4,Aprosecution alleges as rape trial
OL,5,Abegins
OL,6,
OL,7,FRiel Karmy-Jones KC, for the
OL,8,Fprosecution, told Southwark Crown Court
OL,9,Fin London the women "did not know each
OL,10,Fother", "have never met each other" and
OL,11,F"came forward independently of each
OL,12,Fother".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
