OL,3,AWhite House defends new press secretary
OL,4,Aamid questions about her legal
OL,5,Acredentials
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe White House is defending its new
OL,8,Fpress secretary, Katie Zacharia, as she
OL,9,Ffaces scrutiny over her legal
OL,10,Fcredentials.
OL,12,FPresident Donald Trump described
OL,13,FZacharia as an attorney when announcing
OL,14,Fher appointment last week and she has
OL,15,Freferred to herself as a lawyer.
OL,17,FBut when she was asked on Tuesday by a
OL,18,Freporter in which state she had passed
OL,19,Fthe bar exam required to be an attorney
OL,20,Fin the US, she said standing alongside
OL,21,Fthe president: "When I moved to China."
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
